Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, watch as we pass by,\Nas we raise our flag, up high in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.63,0:00:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,here we go now, sailing through the\Nendless ocean, facing all that comes by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's look for our treasure. Nobody has\Never got to witness with their own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is keep believing in our\Ndreams, And let our heart lead the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.70,0:00:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then once we got all the\Nothers left is to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.86,0:00:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,When we face the dark and stormy weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.30,0:00:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the pace, we'll\Nlink our hearts together!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.26,0:00:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm sure we'll make it through!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.84,0:00:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, keep running along!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Still raising our flag as we journey on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.48,0:00:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Though our chances are close to\Nnone, We won't back down from anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start off the chase!\NLet's start off the chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Toward our own dreams,\Nwhile keeping the pace!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.48,0:01:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,With a compass pointing to our goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.84,0:01:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't stop till we've\Ngone around the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.16,0:01:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Start me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.16,0:01:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, keep running along!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll never stop,\Ntill we're at the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that we'll ever quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.80,0:01:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't keep heading for tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.32,0:01:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start up the chase!\NLet's start up the chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.52,0:01:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I see through your eyes\Nwhat we'll have to face!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.48,0:01:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All the memories we'll say in our hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.10,0:01:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never let them go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.38,0:01:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Brand new world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.02,0:01:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.78,0:02:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal with them\Nshooting their own ships?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they that dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.98,0:02:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh great, I got small again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.32,0:02:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Third gear is a pretty cool\Nidea and it is really powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.82,0:02:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But talk about lousy side effects!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.96,0:02:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I was pumped up and\Nbig for about a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.90,0:02:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So I guess I'll He'll be\Nshrunk down for a minute, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.14,0:02:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta hide till this wears off\Nor he'll stomp on me like a bug!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.42,0:02:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a side effect or\Nsome kind of bad joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.82,0:02:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, he's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.92,0:02:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this would have been a waste of\Ntime if he died in a measly cannon attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.32,0:03:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.54,0:03:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You can see the front gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.92,0:03:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost there! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.22,0:03:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.64,0:03:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember your old pal, Franky, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.20,0:03:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He got taken away by the\Nbad guys too, like Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.36,0:03:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So you up for a fight or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.06,0:03:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your precious Straw Hat was\Nrampaging aboard that battleship,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.60,0:03:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and now he's a pile of ashes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.34,0:03:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your captain is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.78,0:03:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and give up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.38,0:03:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.84,0:03:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That ship was filled with their own men.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.02,0:04:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're starting to understand the\Nmerciless nature of the buster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.66,0:04:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Call this is the face of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.76,0:04:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutty Flam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.92,0:04:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now do yourself a favor\Nand hand over Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.44,0:04:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you cooperate with us, I'll see to\Nit that you'll pardon for your crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.32,0:04:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you even bothering\Nto protect this woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what's in it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.12,0:04:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not even a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.02,0:04:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The world government is\Ndevoted to protecting
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.44,0:04:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,normal citizens like you\Nfrom people like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.16,0:04:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really trust her more than us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.50,0:04:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This woman with blood on her hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.60,0:04:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you choose to defy us, well\Nyou remember what happened to Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.72,0:04:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,AAAAAAAH!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.04,0:04:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,OOH! OOH!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,OOH!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.18,0:04:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My... face...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.38,0:04:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think I could\Nget any more swollen...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.04,0:04:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.18,0:04:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's using the elephant sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.66,0:04:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing's unstoppable!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.16,0:04:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, listen, Funnfried, this\Nhas gone on for far too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.14,0:04:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to fatally wound\NMikko-Robin while her guard is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.60,0:05:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.80,0:05:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Elevator!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.36,0:05:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.80,0:05:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He stopped it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You just keep digging your\Ngrave deeper and deeper
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.50,0:05:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Von Freed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.56,0:05:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an elephant, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.82,0:05:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you losing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.88,0:05:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Get mad and slice them caprici!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.34,0:05:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You best make your nose\Nnormal again, elephant?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.76,0:05:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you want a couple of new\Nnostrils in the middle of your forehead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.02,0:05:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.93,0:05:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, there you go. Smart move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.26,0:05:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin, you think Straw Hat\Nand the others are still coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.96,0:05:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Without a doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:05:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.02,0:06:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you once before that\NI'm betting everything on them Spanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.00,0:06:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.72,0:06:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.63,0:06:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I never dreamed this\Nday would actually come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.12,0:06:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'd only had the power\Nbefore, it wouldn't even be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.56,0:06:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm amending the charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.92,0:06:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,For the crime of designing and\Nbuilding a ship for Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.64,0:06:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,the king of the pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.00,0:06:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tom and Tom alone will be apprehended\Nand taken to Annie's lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.98,0:06:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.38,0:06:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the hell got into that\Nold geezer's head? Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.36,0:06:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need his lackeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.40,0:06:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Release those two apprentices!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.56,0:06:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Tom can't be saved from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.64,0:06:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the government we're up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.82,0:06:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do. Endure it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.84,0:06:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tom traded his life for yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.34,0:06:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you make them your enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.06,0:07:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,you won't be able to win, no matter\Nhow many lives you have to give.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.24,0:07:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Benny's lobby is the government's\Npersonal judicial island.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.32,0:07:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Not one single person who's been sent to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.68,0:07:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,that dreadful place has\Never been seen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.78,0:07:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's out of his mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.56,0:07:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.52,0:07:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We keep on going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.88,0:07:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what he wants us to do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.82,0:07:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about him. Right. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.20,0:07:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Puppetop, that's far enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.88,0:07:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you taking your creator?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.04,0:07:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.26,0:07:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.17,0:07:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.18,0:07:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.12,0:08:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me Tom back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it killed me, I had\Nto stop them from taking Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.14,0:08:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows the\Nreputation of any slobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.08,0:08:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And everyone knows the power\Nof the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.20,0:08:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Straw Hats didn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.52,0:08:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,They knew what they were up\Nagainst, and they still pressed on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.64,0:08:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to save their friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.64,0:08:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,they were willing to take on the\Nentire world without hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.02,0:08:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's my kind of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.24,0:08:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never forgotten the role you\Nplayed in Tom's death, and I never will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.56,0:08:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I pictured your stupid\Nface, I dreamt of smashing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.38,0:08:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Smashing your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.86,0:08:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.94,0:08:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.02,0:08:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.93,0:09:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Until there was nothing\Nleft but bloody hamburger!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.58,0:09:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty good start.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.68,0:09:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the Straw Hats, I\Nfinally get to live out this dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.12,0:09:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How about some weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.86,0:09:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I died before and it wasn't that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.48,0:09:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever it takes to\Nget the Straw Hats out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.14,0:09:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,even if it means me\Ndying for a second time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.62,0:09:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over your escort ship right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.40,0:09:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm making them an escape\Nroute and you're helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.84,0:10:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm helping too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.74,0:10:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm alright now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.98,0:10:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look back. Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.38,0:10:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you stay on this island, you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.76,0:10:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Take my raft and go out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.82,0:10:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.98,0:10:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got me, little lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.98,0:10:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid this is the end. Hurry! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.30,0:10:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody I care about is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.52,0:10:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.94,0:10:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nothing like Ohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.48,0:10:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've got nothing to\Nbe afraid of this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.28,0:10:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not alone. This time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.02,0:10:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.38,0:10:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He sniffed me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.20,0:11:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So that power of yours\Ndemands as much as it gives.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.60,0:11:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like a pretty fair trade, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.50,0:11:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,One must always pay a great\Nprice for a great power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Life returned paper art fighting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.46,0:11:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,FINGER PISTOLS!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.02,0:11:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.56,0:11:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If you continue these ridiculous\Nattacks, I'll have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.30,0:11:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.84,0:11:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good, dumb man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.36,0:11:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize, but I've got to\Nkill you in that stupid form.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.10,0:11:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.86,0:11:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Finger pistol! Spots!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.30,0:11:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheep's back body!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.90,0:12:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry up or we're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.76,0:12:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That blow from earlier damaged my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.04,0:12:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's changing. I'm changing back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.58,0:12:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.04,0:12:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.62,0:12:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I messed you up after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.18,0:12:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there really nothing we can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.88,0:13:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to think of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.96,0:13:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't, then we're all going to drown.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.42,0:13:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And we haven't even made\Nsure that Robin is safe yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.08,0:13:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.94,0:13:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I have lived a good life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.66,0:13:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no denying that\NI've had some fun times.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.92,0:13:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not ready to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't drown in a tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.42,0:13:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not a fitting gift for\Nthe brave warrior of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.56,0:13:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Usam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.18,0:13:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hold my breath any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.62,0:13:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.16,0:13:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's starting to go dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.28,0:13:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.20,0:13:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.06,0:13:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.86,0:13:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.38,0:13:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like something's pulling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.68,0:14:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I hallucinating?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.94,0:14:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's gotta be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.32,0:14:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like those old\Ntales that sailors talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.40,0:14:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just before they drown, they\Nsee an elegant tail fin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.32,0:14:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They look up, surprised\Nto see long, flowing hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.24,0:14:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.84,0:14:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like she's something out of a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.40,0:14:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A legendary mermaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.98,0:14:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm dying, and this is just a dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.02,0:14:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,then I don't want to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm running as fast as\Nthis tail will let me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.82,0:14:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,None of you are going to die on my watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.14,0:14:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the mermaid!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.04,0:15:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, boys, but me and the Straw\NHats will be taking this boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.74,0:15:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta escape somehow, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.24,0:15:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And so,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.26,0:15:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,after cleaning house a bit, what was once\Nan escort ship is now our escape ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.98,0:15:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.32,0:15:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.26,0:15:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the others get here, we'll split.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.26,0:15:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.78,0:15:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.90,0:15:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you die on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.52,0:16:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.60,0:16:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The main gates are just ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.96,0:16:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost off this island!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.02,0:16:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It shows a little further! Run, Giants!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.56,0:16:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it all you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.74,0:16:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.32,0:16:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We can finally get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.32,0:16:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna be safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.92,0:16:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Be to the other side!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.06,0:16:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant doors!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.14,0:16:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do nothing when\Nyou've got giant muscles!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.98,0:16:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Three freaking battleships\Nmust have been waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.80,0:16:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, they made it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.76,0:16:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd they get free?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.92,0:16:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We left them tied up in the courthouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.94,0:16:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They're stronger than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.46,0:17:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice admiral, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.38,0:17:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.36,0:17:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim the cannons at them. Sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.34,0:17:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,state your unit, your marine code,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.54,0:17:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and have your picture ID ready to\Nshow before you can board the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.78,0:17:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're good. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.28,0:17:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.72,0:17:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we were gonna\Ngo down with the island
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.86,0:17:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Resistance is futile, pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.14,0:17:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You make one move, and\Nwe'll empty our ammo on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.02,0:17:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This couldn't get any worse! Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.72,0:17:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt they're gonna offer us amnesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.72,0:17:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And we can't go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.04,0:17:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The island's burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.18,0:17:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got nowhere we can run to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.96,0:17:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Every one of their weapons,\Nall of them, aimed at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.00,0:17:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's going through\Nyour head right now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.44,0:17:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking back on my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.58,0:17:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't talk like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.44,0:17:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's either that, or what.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.02,0:18:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What comes next?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.64,0:18:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The afterlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.46,0:18:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our remaining\Npersonnel have boarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.82,0:18:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All ships, retreat to\Na safe firing distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.36,0:18:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not really going\Nto shoot us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.60,0:18:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, battleships 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.00,0:18:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,7 and 8 have identified\Nand reported a large
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.24,0:18:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,number of pirates located\Nin front of the main gate
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.10,0:18:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, all of you, wake up!\NCome on! Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.12,0:18:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.20,0:18:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.04,0:19:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.32,0:19:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have seen something down there\Nthat put them all in a state of shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.68,0:19:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it was, it saved their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.72,0:19:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If they hadn't passed out, they would\Nhave swallowed enough water to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.38,0:19:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, either way, they're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.60,0:19:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Though it does make you\Nwonder what they could
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.70,0:19:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,have seen down there that\Nspooked them so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.40,0:19:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet it was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.44,0:19:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Lock there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.68,0:19:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one that pirate king boy\Nwanted to rescue so bad, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.24,0:19:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.20,0:19:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We met at the ship station.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.06,0:19:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,These Straw Hats are something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.14,0:19:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, I never would have thought you\Nguys could pull off a stunt like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.16,0:19:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't hurry up and put some damn\Nclothes on, I'll gouge my eyes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.56,0:19:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,When he said he was going to be king of\Nthe pirates, I gotta admit, I laughed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.62,0:19:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Gourmet is counting on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.44,0:19:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We're leaving now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.36,0:20:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But now after everything that's\Nhappened, I bet he can actually do it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.66,0:20:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.57,0:20:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,is Nami okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.36,0:20:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,As lively as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.06,0:20:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.86,0:20:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the land of the living.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.48,0:20:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.16,0:20:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Mermaids really don't exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.86,0:20:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So all those old sailor stories are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.18,0:20:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time you think you see a\Nmermaid, it's actually a dugong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.00,0:20:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.08,0:20:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She hasn't even confessed\Nto being a mermaid yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.62,0:20:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop trying to kill my fantasies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.28,0:20:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to be specific,\NI'm an ice fish mermaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.78,0:20:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.69,0:20:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say another word!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.94,0:20:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.14,0:20:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of mermaid lives on\Ndry land and has legs and feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.38,0:20:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to accept this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.34,0:20:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to educate you boys, when we\Nmermaids get to be about 30 years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.64,0:21:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,our tail fin forks in two and we can\Nwalk on land like a regular old human.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.92,0:21:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ever make it out to Fishman\NIsland, you'll see what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.46,0:21:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Their tail split?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.88,0:21:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.79,0:21:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard the same thing happens to a\Ncat's tail if they live to be a hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.84,0:21:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they become goblins.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.38,0:21:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so she's a goblin cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.56,0:21:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lump mermaids in\Nwith those monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.04,0:21:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.22,0:21:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are your manners?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.22,0:21:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I just save your lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.98,0:21:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Granny Kaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.84,0:21:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.00,0:21:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.88,0:21:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what happened? Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.22,0:22:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.58,0:22:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,because of all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.20,0:22:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.64,0:22:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.72,0:22:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,always
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.40,0:22:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,did
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.31,0:22:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,think it was weird
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.23,0:22:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,that you have fins and scales.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.14,0:22:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I know why!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.05,0:22:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How many clues does it take?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.78,0:22:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.44,0:22:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.16,0:22:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.28,0:22:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.54,0:22:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.14,0:22:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.44,0:22:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll explain everything later, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.08,0:22:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.44,0:23:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.35,0:23:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, uh, swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.80,0:23:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here, take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.64,0:23:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard to believe that's the same\Nisland we were on not long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.36,0:23:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.56,0:23:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with this attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.84,0:23:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a sea of flames out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.74,0:23:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I noticed something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.56,0:23:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems kind of like they're trying\Nto avoid firing where Nico Robin's at.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.10,0:23:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That would explain why this\Nbridge hasn't been blown to bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.66,0:23:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If they don't want to kill her, then\Nthey still intend on getting her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.56,0:23:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,After the Marines are done\Nattacking Eni's lobby,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.52,0:23:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll probably come after us with\Nsome hand-to-hand combat to reclaim her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.62,0:23:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like the sound of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.96,0:24:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We're at our limit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.06,0:24:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.04,0:24:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,those battleships are bound to have\Nsome pretty powerful guys on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.20,0:24:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Luffy right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.02,0:24:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,From where I last saw him\Nand what's left standing,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.42,0:24:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say he's there, the\Nfirst tower of that bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.66,0:24:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fighting that damn pigeon guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.88,0:24:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Rob Lucci.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.74,0:24:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.98,0:24:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We should go help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.26,0:24:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.17,0:24:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That pigeon bastard he's\Nfighting is no ordinary man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.88,0:24:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No good could come of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.56,0:24:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If we get caught up in that\Nmess, who knows what'll happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.00,0:24:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Those battleships could\Nturn this way at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.68,0:24:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to make sure we\Nstill have an escape route.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.08,0:24:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan is to stay\Nhere and wait for Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.98,0:24:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the best we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.38,0:25:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The storm is just beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.86,0:25:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.56,0:25:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.70,0:25:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Think your friends are okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.92,0:25:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.58,0:25:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can stop the Franky family.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.64,0:25:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.96,0:25:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.48,0:25:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Paulie!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.88,0:25:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.74,0:25:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A transponder snail?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.40,0:25:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you\Ngoing to do with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.20,0:25:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to find out how the\NStraw Hats are holding up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.82,0:26:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Brow! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.72,0:26:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be the last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.88,0:26:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't stop until I bring you down.
